43
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,950
the steps to roughly cancel out. But a

44
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:59,690
peg is a perfectly fair coin. What if

45
00:01:59,690 --> 00:02:03,210
the randomness is messier? Roll one die. Every

46
00:02:03,210 --> 00:02:05,420
face from one to six is equally likely,

47
00:02:05,420 --> 00:02:07,770
so the picture is flat, no bell at

48
00:02:07,770 --> 00:02:10,420
