61
00:02:43,190 --> 00:02:45,920
follows a bell curve. Almost no matter what

62
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:48,800
each single effect looks like, the details get

63
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:52,210
washed out. Only two things survive. Where the

64
00:02:52,210 --> 00:02:54,740
center is and how wide the spread is.

65
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:57,060
And this explains the list from the start.

66
00:02:57,060 --> 00:02:59,720
Your height comes from thousands of genes and

67
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:02,730
years of food, sleep, and health. Each one

68
00:03:02,730 --> 00:03:04,690
nudging you a little up or a little

69
00:03:04,690 --> 00:03:08,060
