84
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:48,450
the number e shows up. It is the

85
00:03:48,450 --> 00:03:51,380
number of natural growth now running in reverse

86
00:03:51,380 --> 00:03:54,670
as natural decay. Why x squared? Because squaring

87
00:03:54,670 --> 00:03:56,570
makes a mistake to the left to count

88
00:03:56,570 --> 00:03:58,260
the same as a mistake to the right.

89
00:03:58,260 --> 00:04:00,540
And it makes the curve fall off fast.

90
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:02,520
Double the distance and the chance does not

91
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:06,300
just have. It collapses. And now the circle.

92
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:08,490
Those darts spread out in rings around the

93
00:04:08,490 --> 00:04:10,740
