96
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:18,340
around those rings. The area under e to

97
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:20,500
the minus x squared turns out to be

98
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:23,170
exactly the square root of pi. The circle

99
00:04:23,170 --> 00:04:25,140
