103
00:04:33,020 --> 00:04:35,370
pi times e to the power of minus

104
00:04:35,370 --> 00:04:38,500
x minus mu squared over 2 sigma squared.

105
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,850
It looks frightening, but it only has two

106
00:04:40,850 --> 00:04:43,780
