113
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:02,970
the average height is about 175 centimeters and

114
00:05:02,970 --> 00:05:06,000
the standard deviation is about seven. Step one

115
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:09,400
sigma away on each side. From 168 to

116
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:14,360
182 centimeters. That band holds about 68% of

117
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,830
